{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mahjong TPS. It's a mahjong game with unusual rules that use guns and bats.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a substitute player at high-stakes apartment mahjong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around the table to collect tiles and defeat your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0What are the rules?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's mahjong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you collect more points than your opponent by the last round,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > or if you defeat all your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Safe?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Mahjong Table - Battlefield, your mahjong power is tripled, and otherwise it is 1/3. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Game of luck?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can make a difference by stacking your hand or stacking your deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts before you draw. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Goblin?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing away tiles is a basic mahjong action called 'dahai',</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > but you are summoned as a result. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Ikeda from the Home Mahjong Club?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the main character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She challenges high-stakes apartment mahjong to solve the injustice of society with money.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3431340?t=1766675757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766675757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st